{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VuN9kD9LQnGabyt4H2ru9H","type":"tool_result","content":"# pace-bot\n\nA coaching chat bot on Claude for a small running/cycling club. It is stateless\nby design: each message rebuilds the system prompt (coaching rules + the athlete's\nprofile, zones, goal and long-term facts from `data/athletes.json`), picks the tools\nthe message might need (`save_fact` and `log_session` always, planning or race tools\nwhen keywords match) and runs a short tool-use loop. `save_fact` is how the bot\nremembers durable things an athlete tells it; the next message sees the fact in\nits system prompt. Every API call appends its `usage` object to `logs/usage.jsonl`.\n\nRun it locally with `COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-... python3 bot.py 42` and type\nmessages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs\n`COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`).\nRequires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system\nprompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up\nmessages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\n# Notes\n\n## 2026-04-20 — bill doubled since memory shipped\n\nInput spend roughly doubled in the week after `save_fact` went live (2026-04-13),\nwith the same number of messages per day. `logs/usage.jsonl` shows it: on a normal\nmessage the loop rounds and the next message read ~1000 tokens from cache, but\nevery call right after a `save_fact` has `cache_read_input_tokens: 0` and\n`cache_creation_input_tokens` ~1000 again. Athletes tell the bot things about\nthemselves a lot in their first week, so this happens several times per chat.\n\nTried: shorter facts (no change), capping facts at 20 (no change, the number of\nfacts is not the problem). Tool filtering by keyword is from March and was a clear\nwin (~75% fewer tool tokens on short messages); leave it.\n----\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:02:33+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 121, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1090, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 147}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:02:52+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 30, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 84}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:03:24+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 49, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 57, \"tool\": \"predict_race\"}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:04:09+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 133, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1334, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 161}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:04:26+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 23, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 79}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:04:56+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 61, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 41, \"tool\": \"save_fact\"}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:05:39+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 139, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1104, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 155}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:05:54+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 26, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1104, \"output_tokens\": 93}\n----\n30 logs/usage.jsonl\n{\n \"42\": {\"user_id\": \"42\", \"name\": \"Marta\", \"lang\": \"en\", \"sport\": \"running\", \"goal\": \"sub-1:55 half marathon in June\",\n        \"zones\": {\"Z1\": \"<138\", \"Z2\": \"138-152\", \"Z3\": \"152-164\", \"Z4\": \"164-174\", \"Z5\": \">174\"},\n        \"facts\": [\"Runs before work, 06:30, Mon/Wed/Fri\", \"Left achilles tendinopathy in 2024, fully recovered\", \"Owns a Garmin 255\"]},\n \"77\": {\"user_id\": \"77\", \"name\": \"Jonas\", \"lang\": \"de\", \"sport\": \"cycling\", \"goal\": \"finish a 160 km gran fondo in September\",\n        \"zones\": {\"Z1\": \"<130\", \"Z2\": \"130-146\", \"Z3\": \"146-158\", \"Z4\": \"158-168\", \"Z5\": \">168\"},\n        \"facts\": [\"Co","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c844f66b-7d49-4f5c-9839-d41f54baf4e9","uuid":"c3c4649e-afbe-4ed0-a61a-4013c77f4f64","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:09:29.684Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# pace-bot\n\nA coaching chat bot on Claude for a small running/cycling club. It is stateless\nby design: each message rebuilds the system prompt (coaching rules + the athlete's\nprofile, zones, goal and long-term facts from `data/athletes.json`), picks the tools\nthe message might need (`save_fact` and `log_session` always, planning or race tools\nwhen keywords match) and runs a short tool-use loop. `save_fact` is how the bot\nremembers durable things an athlete tells it; the next message sees the fact in\nits system prompt. Every API call appends its `usage` object to `logs/usage.jsonl`.\n\nRun it locally with `COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-... python3 bot.py 42` and type\nmessages on stdin (the Telegram long-polling transport, which needs\n`COACH_TELEGRAM_TOKEN`, lives in a separate deploy repo and just calls `reply()`).\nRequires Python 3.11+ and `pip install anthropic`. Prompt caching is on: the system\nprompt carries a `cache_control` marker so the tool-loop rounds and follow-up\nmessages inside the 5-minute window read it from cache.\n# Notes\n\n## 2026-04-20 — bill doubled since memory shipped\n\nInput spend roughly doubled in the week after `save_fact` went live (2026-04-13),\nwith the same number of messages per day. `logs/usage.jsonl` shows it: on a normal\nmessage the loop rounds and the next message read ~1000 tokens from cache, but\nevery call right after a `save_fact` has `cache_read_input_tokens: 0` and\n`cache_creation_input_tokens` ~1000 again. Athletes tell the bot things about\nthemselves a lot in their first week, so this happens several times per chat.\n\nTried: shorter facts (no change), capping facts at 20 (no change, the number of\nfacts is not the problem). Tool filtering by keyword is from March and was a clear\nwin (~75% fewer tool tokens on short messages); leave it.\n----\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:02:33+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 121, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1090, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 147}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:02:52+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 30, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 84}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:03:24+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 49, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 57, \"tool\": \"predict_race\"}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:04:09+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 133, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1334, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 161}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:04:26+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 23, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 79}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:04:56+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 61, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1090, \"output_tokens\": 41, \"tool\": \"save_fact\"}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:05:39+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 2, \"input_tokens\": 139, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 1104, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 0, \"output_tokens\": 155}\n{\"ts\": \"2026-04-18T08:05:54+00:00\", \"user\": \"42\", \"round\": 1, \"input_tokens\": 26, \"cache_creation_input_tokens\": 0, \"cache_read_input_tokens\": 1104, \"output_tokens\": 93}\n----\n30 logs/usage.jsonl\n{\n \"42\": {\"user_id\": \"42\", \"name\": \"Marta\", \"lang\": \"en\", \"sport\": \"running\", \"goal\": \"sub-1:55 half marathon in June\",\n        \"zones\": {\"Z1\": \"<138\", \"Z2\": \"138-152\", \"Z3\": \"152-164\", \"Z4\": \"164-174\", \"Z5\": \">174\"},\n        \"facts\": [\"Runs before work, 06:30, Mon/Wed/Fri\", \"Left achilles tendinopathy in 2024, fully recovered\", \"Owns a Garmin 255\"]},\n \"77\": {\"user_id\": \"77\", \"name\": \"Jonas\", \"lang\": \"de\", \"sport\": \"cycling\", \"goal\": \"finish a 160 km gran fondo in September\",\n        \"zones\": {\"Z1\": \"<130\", \"Z2\": \"130-146\", \"Z3\": \"146-158\", \"Z4\": \"158-168\", \"Z5\": \">168\"},\n        \"facts\": [\"Co","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VuN9kD9LQnGabyt4H2ru9H","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
